    "If you choose a Journaling Suggestion, Apple presents the system picker. Tinycurve receives only the suggestion content you select, such as a title, date, photo reference, media metadata, workout summary, place, motion summary, contact name, or reflection prompt." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "If you choose a Journaling Suggestion, Apple presents the system picker. Tinycurve receives only the suggestion content you select, such as a title, date, photo reference, media metadata, workout summary, place, motion summary, contact name, or reflection prompt."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "ジャーナリング提案を選ぶ場合、Appleのシステムピッカーが表示されます。Tinycurveが受け取るのは、あなたが選択した提案内容だけです。例として、タイトル、日付、写真参照、メディアメタデータ、ワークアウト概要、場所、モーション概要、連絡先名、リフレクションの問いなどが含まれます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
