    "Journal content remains until you delete it in the app, delete the app's data, or remove it through iCloud behavior controlled by Apple. iCloud sync deletion timing is governed by Apple's CloudKit and iCloud systems." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Journal content remains until you delete it in the app, delete the app's data, or remove it through iCloud behavior controlled by Apple. iCloud sync deletion timing is governed by Apple's CloudKit and iCloud systems."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Journalの内容は、アプリ内で削除する、アプリのデータを削除する、またはAppleが制御するiCloudの動作を通じて削除されるまで残ります。iCloud同期での削除タイミングは、AppleのCloudKitとiCloudシステムによって管理されます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Journaling Suggestions access is used only when you open the system picker. The raw signals used by iOS to prepare suggestions stay with the system unless you select a suggestion." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
