          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When enabled, new entries attach your current location automatically if iOS allows Tinycurve to access it." : {

    },
    "When iCloud is available, Tinycurve uses Apple's CloudKit private database to sync your cards and media across devices signed in to your Apple Account. The developer does not receive a copy of your journal content from this sync." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When iCloud is available, Tinycurve uses Apple's CloudKit private database to sync your cards and media across devices signed in to your Apple Account. The developer does not receive a copy of your journal content from this sync."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "iCloudを利用できる場合、TinycurveはAppleのCloudKitプライベートデータベースを使い、あなたのApple Accountでサインインしているデバイス間でカードとメディアを同期します。この同期によって、開発者があなたの記録内容のコピーを受け取ることはありません。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you create cards, Tinycurve can store the text you type, photos you capture or choose from Photos, audio recordings, doodles, Bauhaus artwork, timestamps, relationships between cards, attachment metadata, and optional location coordinates." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you create cards, Tinycurve can store the text you type, photos you capture or choose from Photos, audio recordings, doodles, Bauhaus artwork, timestamps, relationships between cards, attachment metadata, and optional location coordinates."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "カードを作成すると、Tinycurveは入力したテキスト、撮影または写真アプリから選んだ写真、音声録音、落書き、Bauhausアートワーク、タイムスタンプ、カード同士の関係、添付ファイルのメタデータ、任意の位置座標を保存できます。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "When you use a share action, Tinycurve creates the selected image or video export on device and hands that file to the system share sheet. The destination you choose controls what happens after that." : {
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "When you use a share action, Tinycurve creates the selected image or video export on device and hands that file to the system share sheet. The destination you choose controls what happens after that."
          }
        },
        "ja" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "共有アクションを使うと、Tinycurveは選択された画像または動画の書き出しをデバイス上で作成し、そのファイルをシステム共有シートに渡します。その後の扱いは、あなたが選ぶ共有先によって決まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
